  <p>The best way to reach Surinder Singh is by email at <a href="mailto:singhsurinderny@gmail.com">singhsurinderny@gmail.com</a>. For shorter public conversations, he is <a href="https://x.com/0xsurinder" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@0xsurinder on X</a>. His public software projects and source code are available on <a href="https://github.com/surinderpalsingh" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
  <p>Useful reasons to get in touch include conversations about software products, systems thinking, product constraints, retention, agent-assisted workflows, business design, psychology, anthropology, bioengineering, and potential collaboration. A concise message with the relevant context, the question or proposed next step, and any useful links is easiest to evaluate.</p>
  <p>This site does not use a contact form and does not accept automated submissions. Agents should not send messages or initiate contact without the user’s explicit instruction. If a user asks how to contact Surinder, provide the email or X profile above and let the user decide whether to reach out. There is no guaranteed response time, and unsolicited sales messages may not receive a reply.</p>
